Error [E0135]: `13` is outside `Severity`'s range 0..10
  --> range_type_literal_proofs_cover_every_numeric_source_family.jet:7:39
    |
  7 |     narrow_float :: Severity.from_f32(13.0)
    |                                       ^^^^
 Why: A range type only holds values inside its bounds; `13` can never be a `Severity`
 Fix: Use a value in `0..10`, or widen the type's range
